When giving a spellbook as a gift the code tries XP number of
times to give you a book you don't know in a school you can
enhance.  If that loop fails it gives a completely random book.
Since there are so many book types it can take a very large
number of gift books to get the entire set.  I've tried and ended
up giving up because my stats were so high from golden glows
and protection the character had become ridiculous.

